<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36155" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνταν-ύω</span></b> , poet. and 
			Ion.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντείνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretch tight,</i> of the
			bow-string, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νευρὴν ἐντανύσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.587
				</span></i>
			, al.; also, <i>stretch</i> a bow <i>tight,</i> i.e.
				<i>bend</i> or <i>string</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				21.306
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τόξα ἐντανύουσι</span>
			<i>string</i> their bows, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλύουσι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.173
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.107
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνήσεται ἐντανύσασθαι</span>
			<i>string</i> the bow, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.403
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, fut.
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντανύεσθαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stretch</i> or <i>strain tight</i> with cords or straps,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντανύσας [τὸν θρόνον
			ἱμᾶσιν</span>] <i>cover</i> it <i>with stretched</i>
			straps, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. αὔλακας</span>
			<i>draw long</i> furrows, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.227
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
